# Modules named as the runtime's libraries and its path (`PrismRtl`, `PrismWorldCli`, `Rt`),
# whose types share
# names with the runtime's (`Dynamic`): the emitted code reaches the runtime by its own
# names, so a program module never stands for it, in either target. Written by Claude on
# the claude-bugs branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
mod PrismRtl
mod PrismWorldCli
mod Rt
test mod Tests

@main: @unit
@main:
    Ui.Label(text=$"{PrismRtl.Twice 3} {Show (PrismRtl.Dynamic 2)} {PrismWorldCli.Run 4} {Show (Rt.Hold 5)}")    # 0
